    "title": "Man injured after shooting on Jones Avenue - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Kaitlin Howell ,\n6 hours ago\nJACKSON, Miss. ( WJTV ) – Capitol police are investigating after a man was injured during a shooting.\nThe shooting occurred at a home on Jones Avenue in Jackson around 3:30 p.m. on April 22, 2026.\nWoman charged with arson in multiple Jackson fires When officers arrived, they found the victim with a gunshot wound to the leg. The victim was transported to a local hospital for treatment.\nNo arrests have been made. Anyone with any information can contact Capitol police at 601-359-3125.\nClose Thanks for signing up!\nWatch for us in your inbox.\nSubscribe Now\nDaily News Copyright 2026 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to WJTV.\n2",
